y Park burger. It was delicious. I'd recommend coming here for a tasty burger. The environment is very friendly and the service was great."},{"business_id":"H6qwTMghkuxOoOHEheYo-g","review_id":"q0WbyoTyLgeMyI2j4bvacg","date":"2018-08-07T02:23:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.927544891834259,"text_excerpt":"My wife and I had a craving for burgers tonight. We gave three b's in lakeview a shot and boy they did not disappoint. The place is absolutely gorgeous. I had the south burger and she had the Jose burger. Both of them were cooked to perfection. I will be back!! The couple next to us ordered a chicken sandwich and it also looked delicious. Thank you three bs and welcome to the neighborhood."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"H6qwTMghkuxOoOHEheYo-g","photo_id":"EGXSwl68wNGQo2hG2zE1FQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EGXSwl68wNGQo2hG2zE1FQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8943302631378174},{"business_id":"H6qwTMghkuxOoOHEheYo-g","photo_id":"ZzaDnlwZisH3fIFrrWPwQw","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/ZzaDnlwZisH3fIFrrWPwQw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8776350021362305},{"business_id":"H6qwTMghkuxOoOHEheYo-g","photo_id":"ycq6vKXyWVZxlYjb1OwemA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ycq6vKXyWVZxlYjb1OwemA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7686785459518433},{"business_id":"H6qwTMghkuxOoOHEheYo-g","photo_id":"b61jFSGRemjLNqefdVj6Hw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/b61jFSGRemjLNqefdVj6Hw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7638463973999023},{"business_id":"H6qwTMghkuxOoOHEheYo-g","photo_id":"wsFIBV5EkVnxHHNIVPYHHQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/wsFIBV5EkVnxHHNIVPYHHQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7308287024497986}]},"notebook_case":null}
